Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.00,Hook,,0,0,0,,HOW I MET MY WIFE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,YOU BROUGHT A LAPTOP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.82,0:00:01.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,TO OUR DATE?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.50,0:00:02.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,I'M BUILDING
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.04,0:00:02.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,MY OWN COMPANY.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.66,0:00:03.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,AUTODS.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.38,0:00:03.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,I ALWAYS HAVE
