Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.12,0:00:14.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,BE LIKE THIS.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.94,0:00:15.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,I KNOW.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.26,0:00:17.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,FIVERR WANTS AUTODS.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.54,0:00:18.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,92 MILLION.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.96,0:00:20.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,YOU DID IT!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.94,0:00:21.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,SO. HOW MANY
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.92,0:00:22.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,CUSTOMERS NOW?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.78,0:00:24.05,Cap,,0,0,0,,1.8 MILLION.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.14,0:00:24.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,AND WE'RE NOT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.74,0:00:25.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,STOPPING HERE.
